  "descriptionMarkdown": "This is a nice high volume, compact robot production facility, Producing approximately 1 robot every 2 seconds. (because of the design, it slightly favors producing logistics robots (About 10%)). I am 100% always at my max usable robots, and when I need more, it'll always be in a hurry to max out again.\n\nP.S. To have a complete 50/50 production, let the factory fill up the robot frame belt before turning on the logistics and construction factories.\n\nP.S.S. That's batteries next to the steel in the middle... was running a little low on production when I took the screenshot, you know how it is.",
